00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.007
<v Narrator>N'oge gara aga, ihe ọmụmụ banyere usoro ihe omume na-adabere n'ihe ọmụmụ nke usoro ihe omume ahụ.

2
00:00:08.087 --> 00:00:18.191
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, otu na-ekpebi ọnụ ahịa nke bit na okpomọkụ, otu na-edebe usoro, ma ọ bụ otu na-edebe iwu ebe ịhụnanya ga-enwe uru.

3
00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:27.390
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, n'ime layers niile nke computing, ihe omume ọ bụla ga-eme ka ike ya dị ọcha ma banye na nyocha ndị ọzọ.
